OL,4,BHundred adds semi-finals from 2027     
OL,5,GAn extra match will be added to The    
OL,6,GHundred for the first time in 2027     
OL,7,Gwith the introduction of semi-finals.  
OL,9,FIn the previous six editions of The    
OL,10,FHundred, only the top three qualified  
OL,11,Ffrom the eight-team group stage. First 
OL,12,Fplace went straight to the final, with 
OL,13,Fsecond and third playing in the        
OL,14,Feliminator.                            
OL,16,FNow, the top four will play in         
OL,17,Ftraditional semis in a move designed   
OL,18,Fto increase the competitiveness of the 
OL,19,Fgroup stage and create an extra        
OL,20,Fmarquee fixture.                       
OL,22,D]C                Fixtures 357/358/359 
